    "slug": "rrb-ntpc-recruitment-syllabus-exam-pattern-guide",
    "excerpt": "Wondering what's going on with the upcoming RRB NTPC recruitment for 2026-2027? We break down the vacancies, the syllabus, and what it actually takes to clear the exams.",
    "category": "Railway Jobs",
