    "slug": "sebi-grade-a-assistant-manager-recruitment-guide",
    "excerpt": "Wondering what's going on with the upcoming SEBI Officer Grade A (Assistant Manager) recruitment for 2026-2027? We break down the vacancies, the syllabus, and what it actually takes to clear the exams.",
    "category": "Bank Jobs",
    "section": "Featured Stories",
